{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "de29b9bd-f01a-4c6d-abe7-c44ef8982fbd",
      "name": "Channels",
      "description": {
        "content": "Channels API allows you to integrate your existing messaging channels into Pipedrive through [Messaging app extension](https://pipedrive.readme.io/docs/messaging-app-extension). It enables you to manage and interact with the channel’s conversations, participants and messages inside Pipedrive Messaging inbox: get the historical conversation, receive and send new messages. These endpoints are accessible only through **Messengers integration** OAuth scope together with Messaging manifest in building the [Messaging app extension](https://pipedrive.readme.io/docs/messaging-app-extension).\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "8c0ca29e-a57d-4292-b13f-5c2001edebe3",
